{"unit_id":"HapyRain__dsh-router-laya#card-zh","repo":"HapyRain/dsh-router-laya","commit":"29624e7e89d64d25ba0e6d8b3a6d79a1823c357e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-router-laya 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的自动推理档位路由插件：它在每轮请求前读取用户任务文本，并调用本机 Laya 判定服务选择 low、high 或 max 档，再映射到已配置的模型路由。规则还处理明确档位指令、延续上一轮选择、排除指定档位以及重试升档；判定失败时回退到 low。插件可在后台启动本地服务，并在 Web 输入栏加入显示当前档位、最近判定记录及服务状态的芯片，点击即可切换 Auto 和手动模式。适合希望按任务难度自动调整思考预算的 DSH Web 用户。需要 Node.js 18 以上、Python 3.10 以上及首次约 846 MB 的本地模型权重。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:887-997","service/finetuned_judge.py:209-312","client.js:332-428","bin/setup.mjs:3-10"]}
{"unit_id":"HapyRain__dsh-router-laya#card-en","repo":"HapyRain/dsh-router-laya","commit":"29624e7e89d64d25ba0e6d8b3a6d79a1823c357e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-router-laya routes each DSH web turn to low, high, or max using a local Laya judge, with explicit tier instructions and retry escalation. A composer chip shows recent decisions and switches Auto/manual; setup needs Node 18+, Python 3.10+, and an 846 MB model download.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:887-997","service/finetuned_judge.py:209-312","client.js:332-428","bin/setup.mjs:3-10"]}
