{"unit_id":"HapyRain__dsh-router-laya#feature-1","repo":"HapyRain/dsh-router-laya","commit":"29624e7e89d64d25ba0e6d8b3a6d79a1823c357e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-router-laya 的功能「按任务选择档位」：每轮消息被接收后，本地判定器选择 low、high 或 max，并映射为模型、推理档位配置；同一轮的后续请求复用判定结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:887-967","index.js:387-392"]}
